      "writtenOn": "2023-09-13T17:53:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The compiler wants to insert trailing padding here to push the struct to be 24 bytes wide (instead of 20 bytes wide).\nDemonstration: https://godbolt.org/z/TzqasEaox",
